From 3759e6573b03bb05da7a45d88398c7ad9ceda28c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mawleesys <alsoalberdo@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:13:48 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Shop: in-game delivery of configured privilege purchases
 (behind flag)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ConfiguredDeliveryService + shop:configured-delivery (scheduled every minute):
  pending purchase -> privilege_reconcile (LuckPerms group, capabilities, node expiry) and
  kit_redeem per kit line through the existing AzLink operations poll/ack transport;
  all succeeded -> purchase active + delivered; failed/uncertain visible; term end -> expire
  entitlement and privilege_revoke (renewal successor is reconciled instead).
- Deterministic operation keys make every dispatch exactly-once (replay-safe).
- Admin page Продажи -> «Выдача в игре» with per-operation status, attempts and errors.
- Setting shop.configured_delivery.enabled (default 0).
